# ---- Secrets ----
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Exported browser cookies (YouTube Music sign-in; exporters name the file
# cookies.txt or <host>_cookies.txt), a SecretStore folder, the iPhone app's
# keys, and the Last.fm key header (and the .candidate it is written through)
# should a build ever be configured inside the source tree. Only
# apicredentials.h.in is committed.
*cookies*.txt
*.cookies
secrets/
Secrets.plist
apicredentials.h
apicredentials.h.*
!apicredentials.h.in
